+# init: types' members: your code mixes both forms (83 in BRO1001's order, 46 in another order), so BRO1001 is off. To choose one: set dotnet_diagnostic.BRO1001.severity and remove the next line.
+dotnet_diagnostic.BRO1001.severity = none
+# init: lambda-first calls: rest on the lambda's last line in 4 of 4 calls in your code
